cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Sw-SSFCM — reference implementation
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  accompanying paper listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nguyen
    given-names: Xuan Hoang
  - family-names: Mai
    given-names: Dinh Sinh
  - family-names: Nguyen
    given-names: Long Giang
repository-code: https://github.com/longlinh/Sw-SSFCM_Algs
abstract: >-
  NumPy reference implementation of Sw-SSFCM, a semi-supervised fuzzy c-means
  whose distance is augmented by a frozen spatial prior obtained as the
  log-opinion pool of the Softmax posterior over the pixel neighbourhood,
  together with the Sr-SSFCM (r = 0) control and a self-contained synthetic
  demonstration.
keywords:
  - fuzzy c-means
  - semi-supervised clustering
  - hyperspectral imaging
  - remote sensing
  - opinion pooling
  - spatial prior
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-08-24'
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    A novel approach to spatial-weighted semi-supervised fuzzy c-means
    clustering for hyperspectral image analysis
  authors:
    - family-names: Nguyen
      given-names: Xuan Hoang
    - family-names: Mai
      given-names: Dinh Sinh
    - family-names: Nguyen
      given-names: Long Giang
  journal: Computers and Geosciences
  year: 2026
  notes: Under review. DOI to be assigned on acceptance.
